@title Problem triangles T9: an unreadable suppliers.json leaves a triangle in the supplier strip
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
@area Parts
# The supplier list problem used to be a coloured sentence; now it is a triangle with the detail in its popover.
supplier_list qa/fixtures/parts/suppliers-broken.json
fresh
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text Parts
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
click_text "Get parts from supplier"
wait 10
shot supplier-menu
click 480 49
wait 6
expect "suppliers.json not read"
shot supplier-triangle
check_layout
